	)
	(text "Todo:\n\nAdd connectors for faders\n	To MCU & to faders\nAdd connectors for io & display\n	Need display info\nSPDIF\n	Toslink optocoupler & Coax signal buffers\n\nAnalog buffer between dac and amplifier\n	Implement MFB filter using OPA1612/1611\n		Read TI reference for filter implementation\n		Use filter scheme in DAC datasheet (AK4493)\n	Use tight resistors & capacitors\n		\nConnectivity\nSPDIF COAX\nTOSLINK\n\nUSB connector\nBarrel jack\n\n3.5mm line in \nRCA in \n\nXLR balanced out (x2)\nRCA line out\n3.5mm headphone out"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.078 43.434 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "53bde1f5-774a-4768-a791-6f4ffa5820f3")
	)
	(text_box "Notes:\n	VM smoothing cap value ≥ 10u\n	VINT cap rated for ≥ 6.3V\n	VCP cap using X7R & rated for ≥ 16V\n	R1 & R2 for current sense - not strictly necessarry \n	~{SLEEP} internal pulldown - required high for operation\n	~{FAULT} requires external pulldown - signals overtemp / overcurrent\n	xISEN voltage range: -0.3 - 0.5 V; Motors driven @ 5V -> 625mA = ±0.125V\n	Digital inputs may be driven up to 5.25V\n	Faders should be connected to MCU power, NOT motor DC/DC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 78.74 0)
		(size 92.71 22.225)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6bd26619-a890-4325-bf54-3a4a2cc17b56")
	)
	(text_box "Consult datasheet for sourcing of inductor & capacitors\nEN pulled high -> device will always be operational when powered\nPlace C4 between DC/DC & motor driver\nConnect EN to MCU - Can be turned off periodically to reduce noise\nFor inductor use Wurth 744393305033\nFor c_out use Wurth 885012107018\nFor c_boot use Wurth 885012206095"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 115.57 58.42 0)
		(size 88.9 19.05)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
